        "app_name": "Golden Gloves Boxing",
        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "Play, train and compete with Golden Gloves Boxing, the official game for the legendary Golden Gloves of America! Building on 100 years of history, we’re proud to bring the most recognizable brand in boxing into the digital world. Experience the thrill of training like a fighter in our virtual gym and immerse yourself in the rigorous fitness workout of America’s best. Starting as a novice boxer, you’ll follow a career path, working your way through the ranks to become a Golden Gloves Champion. \n\nThis game is also about community and collaboration. Thanks to partnerships with boxing icons like Matchroom Boxing, USA Boxing, and Golden Gloves Boxing, we offer an authentic gym experience. The only thing missing is the feel of the punching bag.\n\nCrafted by Engine Room VR, this virtual gym was developed for you by a licensed boxing coach, promoter, and gym owner. Face opponents with unique fight styles and personalities. Every punch, dodge, and move is powered by realistic physics, creating a lifelike boxing experience that rivals real-world gyms.\n\n- Train: Practice your technique\n- Fight: Compete in a multiplayer experience\n- Workout: Track your progress\n\nWhat are you waiting- lace up your gloves and get in the ring!\n",
